OL,3,AHe spent $50,000 on Labubus but now the
OL,4,Acraze is dying
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor years, Labubu dolls seemed
OL,7,Funstoppable.
OL,9,FCollectors young and old energetically
OL,10,Fsnapped up "blind boxes" - sealed,
OL,11,Fmystery packages containing the quirky
OL,12,Fmonsters - often paying $15 (#11) or
OL,13,Fmore.
OL,15,FThose unable to get the characters they
OL,16,Fwanted were often prepared to pay much
OL,17,Fmore on the resale market.
