OL,3,AHe spent $50,000 on Labubus but now the
OL,4,Acraze is dying
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe hype around the creatures convinced
OL,7,Fa mega-fan from North Carolina, who
OL,8,Fgoes by the name Ensito, to leave his
OL,9,Ftech job in 2024 to create Labubu
OL,10,Fcontent full-time, travelling as far as
OL,11,FItaly and Spain to seek out the latest
OL,12,Freleases.
